{"version":1,"key":"card:189","content":{"id":189,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e379e28c-84b5-4994-b4e8-92c705c8b3b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子，使用 Canvas 制作动画。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c09be2a0-ee01-425a-8b4d-417aa4eb7579","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先动画本质是图像快速的变化，使得我们感觉动起来了，所以制作动画主要分为两步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8d36ebc4-1029-4004-ad97-46efac8caed4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e9b08291-c405-42db-b92f-30ab9c1a216a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35f7525d-61c2-40fa-83e4-a3b90aab6103","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"清除上一幅图像"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cf86a34c-1dbb-405d-b539-d1db73091f4f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd54abc7-2f7b-4b3b-b6b9-1ebaba71f0d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制新的图像"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"277f82ab-bd88-400d-8171-12e9b8ca1b2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个需要关注的问题就是什么时候绘制一个新的图像，一般来说我们要求 1s 内绘制 60 幅图像，这样我们才不会感觉到卡顿， 一般我们将绘制的时机交给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestAnimationFrame"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它会决定在什么时候来决定动画，相比于通过定时器 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setInterval"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setTimeout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行绘制，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestAnimationFrame"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能保证稳定的刷新频率。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb4138e6-711c-4a4c-86a0-171d1f57ad69","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这里给出一个简单的小球运动的动画，来了解使用 Canvas 制作动画的基本流程。首先我们构建一个 Ball 类，其中保存了小球所在的位置，小球的半径，填充颜色，运动速度和加速度"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"aaf965fa-9d68-4fd9-8702-eca704a4e7a5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9934b1bf-e70d-441f-9425-fe468194dc94","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Ball {\n  constructor(ctx, x, y, r, vx = 0, vy = 0, ax = 0, ay = 0, color = '#1781b5') {\n    this.ctx = ctx\n    this.x = x\n    this.y = y\n    this.r = r\n    this.vx = vx\n    this.vy = vy\n    this.ax = ax\n    this.ay = ay\n    this.color = color\n  }\n\n  draw() {\n    this.ctx.beginPath()\n    this.ctx.save()\n    this.ctx.fillStyle = this.color\n    this.ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.r, 0, 2 * Math.PI)\n    this.ctx.fill()\n    this.ctx.restore()\n  }\n\n  move() {\n    this.ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height)\n    this.vx = this.vx + this.ax\n    this.vy = this.vy + this.ay\n    this.x = this.x + this.vx\n    this.y = this.y + this.vy\n    this.draw()\n\t\trequestAnimationFrame(this.move.bind(this))\n  }\n}","collabId":"69e36339-7801-43d7-be54-30e9cad45215","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2de09a9c-4ad9-4922-b1cf-76d533f5e95c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(x, y)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示小球的圆心坐标，r 表示小球的直径，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"vx"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"vy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分别表示小球在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方向和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方向上的速度，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ax"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ay"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分别表示小球在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方向和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"y"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方向上的加速度，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"color"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示小球的填充颜色。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8539f5b0-7b69-439a-b7eb-59b7caa70a91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着写了两个方法，当调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"draw"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法时，会在画布上将小球绘制出来，为了不影响画布的绘图状态，在绘制小球之前需要将画布的绘图状态存储起来，然后绘制完小球后再将状态恢复。当调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"move"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法时，会根据小球的速度与加速度信息，更新小球的速度以及位置，然后将小球绘制出来，在绘制新的小球之前，需要调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"clearRect"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将之前绘制的小球清除。为了使得小球不断的运动，在最后我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requestAnimationFrame(this.move.bind(this))"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不断的调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"move"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"946d67b1-6830-42ac-8320-d5f0990a16cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面我们创建一个小球对象，并且调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"move()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法使它动起来"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a0b3d572-6360-4b32-a220-b2a90ae77e3b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ce474b52-1cdc-4ab4-a0d8-75177c55daab","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const canvas = document.getElementById('canvas')\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d')\n\n// 起始位置 (100, 100)，小球半径 10，初速度 vx=5, vy=0, ax=0, ay=0.5 (平抛运动)\nconst ball = new Ball(ctx, 100, 100, 10, 5, 0, 0, .5)\nrequestAnimationFrame(ball.move.bind(ball))","collabId":"7dd2843f-4f24-4fe8-8298-15fe241a3931","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78328b04-7751-4cdf-8df4-898d82725eee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"小球动起来了，但是小球很快就从画布中出去了，你可以狠狠点击"},{"type":"link","url":"https://lastknightcoder.github.io/canvas-demos/58.html","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"b5997015-39e3-4ed1-919d-0f03f5e75330","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"进行查看。我们希望当小球到达画布边缘时，有一个碰撞的行为，我们可以在 move 方法中进行碰撞检测"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"57b6531f-069a-4041-8cbb-6381107fa8e0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bdd5f9f1-083b-4425-9deb-a707ae634057","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"move() {\n  this.ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height)\n  this.vx = this.vx + this.ax\n  this.vy = this.vy + this.ay\n  this.x = this.x + this.vx\n  this.y = this.y + this.vy\n\n\t// 当小球与画布下边缘碰撞时，vy 反向，并且速度变为之前的 0.8，vx 的速度也变为之前的 0.8\n\t// 并更新小球的底部与下边缘相切\n  if (this.y + this.r > canvas.height) {\n    this.y = canvas.height - this.r\n    this.vy = -0.8 * this.vy\n    this.vx = 0.8 * this.vx\n  }\n\t// 当来到画布的左右两侧时，vx 的方向发生改变，并且更新小球与边缘相切\n  if (this.x + this.r > canvas.width || (this.x - this.r) < 0) {\n    this.x = this.x + this.r > canvas.width ? canvas.width - this.r : this.r\n    this.vx = -this.vx\n  }\n\n  this.draw()\n  requestAnimationFrame(this.move.bind(this))\n}","collabId":"0b62abc4-938f-4323-abac-5c4b63e80073","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"47b3a773-1d08-4f7e-968c-aab2c2fa5532","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时便可以观察到小球的碰撞效果了，你可以狠狠点击"},{"type":"link","url":"https://lastknightcoder.github.io/canvas-demos/59.html","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"cb83a26e-4b1e-4832-9812-84c7d8b33136","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"查看效果。"}]}],"tags":["Canvas/动画"],"createTime":1690384546335,"updateTime":1743303640408,"linkedCards":[{"id":173,"target":{"key":"card:173","type":"card","id":173},"summary":"由于绘制矩形非常的常见，Canvas 特意提供了 API 来绘制矩形 rect(x, y, width, height) ，其中 (x, y) 表示矩形左上角的坐标， width 和 height 分别表示矩形的宽度和长度 ctx.rect...","tags":["Canvas"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640408}}